<title>CHINA: Four Seas Travel yr net up 71.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Four Seas Travel yr net up 71.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.1	 vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	  vs 2.7</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  12.12 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    27.17	vs 15.87</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,510.31   vs 1,498.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Four Seas Travel International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 19-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 21</p>
<p>NOTE - Four Seas Travel engages in the sale of airline tickets and the provision of other related travel services and property investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 4.3 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.3 cents) vs four cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
